        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Park City, Kansas; Interstate 135\n- Organizations: Wild West World; Wichita Greyhound Park\n- People: Phil Ruffin\n- Products: Treasure Island Hotel and Casino\n\nFacts:\n- Phil Ruffin was born on March 14, 1935, and he is an American businessman.\n- Wild West World was a Wild West theme park in Park City, Kansas.\n- Wild West World opened on May 5, 2007.\n- Wild West World was located on 130 acres along Interstate 135 near Phil Ruffin's Wichita Greyhound Park.\n- Wild West World closed on July 9, 2007.\n- Wichita Greyhound Park closed in 2007.\n- Since March 2009, Treasure Island Hotel and Casino has been owned and operated by Phil Ruffin.",
